# Author-controlled docs — never auto-format
**/CHANGELOG.md

# Generated from the rule registry by `pnpm --filter @goflag/cli
# generate:catalog`, and compared against it byte for byte by `catalog.test.ts`.
# Prettier's JSON output differs from the generator's, so formatting it here
# breaks that comparison — the file has exactly one author and it is a script.
packages/cli/rules.json

# Test fixtures — captured verbatim from real sites and synthetic edge cases;
# keep byte-for-byte identical. Globbed from any depth so the pattern survives
# packages moving around the workspace.
**/fixtures/**

# Agent worktrees: full checkouts of this repository living inside it. Git skips
# them through .git/info/exclude, which Prettier does not read — so without this
# line `format:check` reports on somebody else's uncommitted work in a copy that
# never reaches CI, and doubles the files it walks.
.claude/
